      "prompt": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the auburn-haired woman in mustard cardigan and jeans from <Picture 2> and <Picture 3>, on the left. <Subject 2> is the silver-haired man in navy work coveralls from <Picture 4> and <Picture 5>, on the right. Her German voice is warm mid-pitched, his German voice calm low-pitched slightly rough. <Subject 3> is the exact cockpit of <Picture 1>: two graphite consoles, red seats, off-white panels, two amber light strips, one trapezoidal panoramic front window with a single center mullion, planet low right.\nsummary: Two crew members notice an approaching contact and decide to wait.\nretention_analysis: Preserve the established geometry, lighting, subject identities and materials from the images. <Picture 1> is the exact first view.\ndetailed_description: Naturalistic cinematic live-action, stable exposure and coherent physical motion. [Shot 1] Wide cockpit view, woman left and man right, both clearly visible. The woman glances down at her console then at the man and says <d>[German] Da draußen ist ein zweites Schiff.</d> Her lips match the words and close; he listens with closed lips, then turns his head toward the forward window. He answers <d>[German] Bleiben wir ruhig. Vielleicht suchen sie Hilfe.</d> His lips match the words and close; she listens with lips pressed together.\nThe camera remains in this exact wide two-shot for the entire clip. After his sentence, both remain at their stations and quietly watch the forward window. Their heads turn gently while the composition stays fixed. The background is the same starting view: black star field and the curved blue planet low on the right. One continuous locked-off shot.\n\noverall_soundscape: Clear German dialogue in a quiet cabin, one soft console beep when she looks down, slight clothing rustle with the head turns.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
